n of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T04:02:46.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge denies SEC's request for TRO against LSU in Dec. 3 vote","description":"A federal judge denied the SEC's request for a temporary restraining order to keep LSU from interfering with a Dec. 3 vote of presidents and chancellors on whether to remove the school from the conference.","published":"2026-11-25T20:02:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 13 Game Day Kickoff: Nothing compares to the outright hatred of a rival","description":"What to expect in Rivalry Week, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff112526/week-13-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Oklahoma State extends Morris with new 6-year deal","description":"Oklahoma State and head coach Eric Morris have agreed to a new six-year deal that will extend his contract through the 2032 season, sources told ESPN's Pete Thamel on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T17:00:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50594432/sources-oklahoma-state-extends-morris-new-six-year-deal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-25T15:16:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: USC favored at UCLA, Texas double-digit faves at Texas A&M","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for UCLA-USC, Texas A&M-Texas and more.","published":"2026-11-25T15:00:51.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50571004/2026-college-football-week-13-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Manuel to remain Michigan AD until new hire is found","description":"Warde Manuel has agreed to stay in the job as Michigan's athletic director until the school finds a new athletic director, sources told ESPN on Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T16:12:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50592920/sources-manuel-stay-job-new-michigan-ad-hired","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079426/wendell-gregory","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wendell_Gregory"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Wendell Gregory","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wendell_Gregory","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Wendell J. Gregory (born January 27, 2006) is an American college football defensive end for the Kansas State Wildcats. He previously played for the South Carolina Gamecocks and Oklahoma State Cowboys.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gregory is from Marietta, Georgia. He attended George Walton Comprehensive High School in Marietta where he played football, initially as a wide receiver before moving to linebacker as a sophomore. Across his sophomore and junior seasons, he tallied 86 tackles, 11 tackles-for-loss (TFLs), 5.5 sacks and two interceptions. He then had 56 tackles, 18 TFLs and seven sacks as a senior in 2023, helping Walton to a record of 14–1 with an appearance in the 7A state championship. A four-star recruit, Gregory was ranked by 247Sports as the 12th-best linebacker prospect and the 130th-best player nationally in the recruiting class of 2024. He committed to play college football for the South Carolina Gamecocks."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at South Carolina in 2024, Gregory appeared in two games and redshirted, posting a tackle, while playing as a defensive end. He entered the NCAA transfer portal after the season and transferred to the Oklahoma State Cowboys. He became a starter for the Cowboys in 2025. Through nine games, he was the leader among FBS freshmen with 10.5 tackles-for-loss. He was named a semifinalist for the Shaun Alexander Freshman of the Year award."}]}}